{"about_the_game":"A place to <strong>unwind, mix drinks, and serve warm meals</strong> to charming guests\u2014whether in f<strong>ullscreen or tucked neatly at the bottom of your screen</strong> as you go about your day.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/GIF_0_update_20.03.gif?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/Title_Art_1_608x59.png?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br>Keep your bar stocked, set the perfect table, and welcome your guests with care. After all, the heart of a great bar is the people inside it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/GIF_1_c\u00f3_frame.gif?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/Title_Art_2_608x59.png?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br>Hire staff to keep things running while you sit back and relax. No rush, no pressure\u2014just the soothing hum of a bar that flows on its own.<br>And... of course, if the mood strikes, you can always jump in.               <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/GIF_2_c\u00f3_frame.gif?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/Title_Art_3_608x59.png?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br>Style your bar, set the mood, and make it the coziest spot by the lake. And don\u2019t forget the little yard above\u2014it\u2019s yours to decorate and shape however you like.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/GIF_3_c\u00f3_frame.gif?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/Title_Art_4_608x59.png?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br>Lakeside Bar isn\u2019t just about simple routines\u2014there\u2019s always something fun to do. Try your hand at fishing, test your aim at darts, and stay tuned for more surprises!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/GIF_4_c\u00f3_frame.gif?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/Title_Art_5_608x59.png?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br>Just enter your Twitch channel name, and Lakeside Bar will link your chatters' names to customers in the game, turning them into guests at your bar.<br>A little touch of magic to bring you and your community closer together.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/Twitch.png?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/Title_Art_6_608x59.png?t=1751536885\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock new drinks, snacks, and music.<br></li><li>Try out fresh recipes to impress your guests.<br></li><li>Expand your resources for a smoother flow.<br></li><li>And much more, all at your pace!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417120?t=1751536885","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751536885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com