, snacks, and music.<br></li><li>Try out fresh recipes to impress your guests.<br></li><li>Expand your resources for a smoother flow.<br></li><li>And much more, all at your pace!</li></ul>","developers":["BITCOVER"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/b4f66c8d3913502d2754571537601dc1083aaf36/header.jpg?t=1751536885","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125746,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125746/movie480.mp4?t=1750672376","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125746/movie_max.mp4?t=1750672376"},"name":"Trailer Demo version_Eng_17.05","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125746/95ec2219e104cd4ad52850e0ddee467c1b855d8c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750672376","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125746/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750672376","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125746/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750672376"}}],"name":"Lakeside Bar","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3 @ 3.2 GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["BITCOVER","CC_Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gat